From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 03:41:51 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] Read the shown invite by its id

The invite sheet on macOS and the invite dialog on Android found their
invite among the open invites the apps held, and closed when it was no
longer among them. Each now follows a live query of its invite by id,
which reads none once the invite ends, and closes on that.

