From 7f7a0d0236f4503817dbfea7ad72bc17713fac0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:38:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] Return the last-used save preset with the config

The config carried the last-used preset's id, and the macOS Save as
settings looked the preset up among the presets to show its extension.
The config read now joins the preset to the id the preferences name and
carries it whole, and the apps read it from there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
