From d5cfcbff16f4404ba1494a7d02c073038a5772f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:43:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] Change save presets one at a time

The settings wrote the whole preset list back for every change, and the
Mac editor checked a new name against the presets it had loaded. Core now
takes an add, a replace and a delete of one preset, refuses an added or
changed preset whose name another has, and answers that refusal so the
editor shows it under the name field.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
